<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Taubman cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Taubman cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Taubman Centers Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate and kept its long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Tuesday at 11-7/8.</p>
</text>
